<title>SPAIN: MOTOCROSS-MOTOCROSS DES NATIONS RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>MOTOCROSS-MOTOCROSS DES NATIONS RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JEREZ, Spain 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Motocross</p>
<p>des Nations event on Sunday:</p>
<p>First race (for 125cc and 500cc):</p>
<p>1. Steve Lamson (U.S.) 125 Honda</p>
<p>2. Sebastien Tortelli (France) 125 Kawasaki </p>
<p>3. Jeff Emig (U.S.) 500 Kawasaki</p>
<p>4. Stefan Everts (Belgium) 125 Suzuki</p>
<p>5. Frederic Bolley (France) 500 Kawasaki</p>
<p>6. Dietmar Lacher (Germany) 500 Honda</p>
<p>Second race (for 125cc and 250cc)</p>
<p>1. Jeremy McGrath (U.S.) 250 Honda</p>
<p>2. Marnicq Bervoets (Belgium) 250 Suzuki</p>
<p>3. Lamson</p>
<p>4. Tortelli</p>
<p>5. Pit Beirer (Germany) 250 Honda</p>
<p>Third race (for 250cc and 500cc)</p>
<p>1. McGrath</p>
<p>2. Bervoets</p>
<p>3. yves Demaria (France) 250 Yamaha</p>
<p>4. Beirer</p>
